  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption - (1): 3 and 4\n\n79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175 ⇒ 79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 4 – (30 ÷ 15) × 3 = 175\n\n79 – 43 + __**(23 + 75)**__ × 4 – __**(30 ÷ 15)**__ × 3 = 175\n\n79 – 43 + __**98 × 4**__ – __**2 × 3**__ = 175\n\n__**79 + 392**__ - 43 - 6 = 175 \n\n__**471 - 43 - 6**__ = 175\n\n422 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (2): 23 and 43\n\n79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175 ⇒ 79 – 23 + (43 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175\n\n79 – 23 + __**(43 + 75)**__ × 3 – __**(30 ÷ 15)**__ × 4 = 175\n\n79 – 23 + __**118 × 3**__ – __**2 × 4**__ = 175\n\n__**79 + 354**__ - 23 - 8 = 175\n\n__**433 - 23 - 8**__ = 175\n\n402 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (3): 75 and 30\n\n79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175 ⇒ 79 – 43 + (23 + 30) × 3 – (75 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175\n\n79 – 43 + __**(23 + 30)**__ × 3 – __**(75 ÷ 15)**__ × 4 = 175\n\n79 – 43 + __**53 × 3**__ – __**5 × 4**__ = 175\n\n__**79 + 159**__ - 43 - 20 = 175\n\n__**238 - 43 - 20**__ = 175\n\n**175 = 175 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption - (4): 75 and 79\n\n79 – 43 + (23 + 75) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175 ⇒ 75 – 43 + (23 + 79) × 3 – (30 ÷ 15) × 4 = 175\n\n75 – 43 + __**(23 + 79)**__ × 3 – __**(30 ÷ 15)**__ × 4 = 175\n\n75 – 43 + __**102 × 3**__ – __**2 × 4**__ = 175\n\n__**75 + 306**__ - 43 - 8 = 175\n\n__**381 - 43 - 8**__ = 175\n\n330 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
